# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The developer guide is located at [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-addon-sqd/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md) in the root of this project’s repository. By participating, you are expected to uphold Qiskit’s [code of conduct](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md).\n"
msgstr "Panduan pembangun terletak di [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-addon-sqd/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md) dalam akar repositori projek ini. Dengan menyertai, anda dijangka menegakkan [tatakelakuan](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md) Qiskit.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We use [GitHub issues](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-addon-sqd/issues/new/choose) for tracking requests and bugs.\n"
msgstr "Kami menggunakan [isu GitHub](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-addon-sqd/issues/new/choose) untuk menjejak permintaan dan pepijat.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Citing this package {#citing-this-package}"
msgstr "Memetik pakej ini {#citing-this-package}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you use this package in your research, use the [CITATION.bib](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-addon-sqd/blob/main/CITATION.bib) file in this project’s repository to cite the appropriate reference(s).\n"
msgstr "Jika anda menggunakan pakej ini dalam penyelidikan anda, gunakan fail [CITATION.bib](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-addon-sqd/blob/main/CITATION.bib) dalam repositori projek ini untuk memetik rujukan yang sesuai.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Acknowledgements {#acknowledgements}"
msgstr "Penghargaan {#acknowledgements}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This package includes an optional sampling strategy within the self-consistent configuration recovery loop that trims determinants based on intermediate diagonalization results. The implementation is based on joint research from the Cleveland Clinic Foundation, RIKEN, and IBM. If you use this feature in your research, please also use the citation for the paper, which can be found in the [CITATION.bib](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-addon-sqd/blob/main/CITATION.bib) file with citation key `merz2026crossing`. An implementation of the full workflow from that paper is expected to be available on GitHub soon.\n"
msgstr "Pakej ini termasuk strategi pensampelan pilihan dalam gelung pemulihan konfigurasi swakonsisten yang memangkas determinan berdasarkan keputusan pepenyahdiagonalan perantaraan. Pelaksanaan ini berdasarkan penyelidikan bersama daripada Cleveland Clinic Foundation, RIKEN, dan IBM. Jika anda menggunakan ciri ini dalam penyelidikan anda, sila gunakan juga petikan bagi kertas kerja tersebut, yang boleh didapati dalam fail [CITATION.bib](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-addon-sqd/blob/main/CITATION.bib) dengan kunci petikan `merz2026crossing`. Pelaksanaan aliran kerja penuh daripada kertas kerja itu dijangka tersedia di GitHub tidak lama lagi.\n"

