# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deprecation Policy {#deprecation-policy}"
msgstr "Dasar Penghentian Sokongan {#deprecation-policy}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We follow [semantic versioning](https://semver.org/). We may occasionally make breaking changes in order to improve the user experience. When possible, we will keep old interfaces and mark them as deprecated, as long as they can co-exist with the new ones. Each substantial improvement, breaking change, or deprecation will be documented in the [release notes](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-addon-sqd/release-notes).\n"
msgstr "Kami mengikut [pengversian semantik](https://semver.org/). Kadangkala kami mungkin membuat perubahan yang memecahkan keserasian demi memperbaik pengalaman pengguna. Apabila boleh, kami akan mengekalkan antara muka lama dan menandakannya sebagai ditamatkan sokongan, selagi ia boleh wujud bersama yang baharu. Setiap peningkatan besar, perubahan yang memecahkan keserasian, atau penamatan sokongan akan didokumenkan dalam [nota keluaran](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-addon-sqd/release-notes).\n"

